```
id: SPL-012
name: Application consent or credential added
description: Admin or user consent granted, or a credential added to an application or service
   principal.
platform: Splunk
mitre_tactic: Credential Access
mitre_technique: T1528 Steal Application Access Token
severity: Medium
data_source: index=azure (audit logs)
false_positives: Developer activity; approved vendor integrations.
tuning: Allow-list approved publishers; restrict user consent in the tenant.
test_method: Register an app in a lab tenant, grant consent and add a secret.
owner: <OWNER>
status: Draft
last_review: 2026-11-19
```
index=azure sourcetype="mscs:azure:eventhub" category=AuditLogs earliest=-1h
    operationName IN ("Consent to application","Add delegated permission grant","Add service principal credentials","Add application")
| eval actor=coalesce('properties.initiatedBy.user.userPrincipalName','properties.initiatedBy.app.displayName')
| eval app='properties.targetResources{}.displayName'
| table _time operationName actor app result
| sort - _time
